    ("v683_rank3_functionals", "PRIME.RANK3FUNC.01: OFFENSIVE 2 -- the arithmetic bottleneck of the parity-Toeplitz rank-3 theorem lifted EXACTLY: the prime influence on the load-bearing 2x2 Gram block is THREE linear functionals S_j(a) of the comb weights, and every entrywise proof route is adjudicated for circularity (19 checks, ~2 s; discovery probe rank3_functionals_probe.py 19/19, T-A/T-PAIR/T-B class (c), T-ENTRY class (a), CS-POINTWISE-FAIL, PRET-BREAKS).  [E] the three functionals exact: closed-form assembly vs independent sieve at 4.9e-16 (formulas 1.3e-15, mpmath reference 1.6e-16).  [MEASURED] THE CIRCULARITY VERDICT (Schoenfeld / exact-envelope budgets): T-A det-positivity via per-entry budgets CLASS (c)/(c) (min det M/Delta_A = 0.0259/0.1329); T-PAIR lifted single-functional pairing CLASS (c)/(c) (0.0282/0.1539); the load-bearing absorption target T-B (det Ahat >= 0) CLASS (c)/(c) with min margin/Delta_B = 4.65e-07/2.10e-06 -- THE ROUNDABOUT CONFIRMED at the absorption level: the razor-thin margin demands ~1e6 x more than ANY entrywise input delivers (measured collective-cancellation gain 378-712); T-ENTRY class (a) (max budget usage 0.0065/0.0202); the surviving det-level form |D(M,F) + det F| <= kappa det M with measured kappa_max = 0.08946 << 1.  [MEASURED] NO Cauchy-Schwarz win: pointwise W12^2 <= W11 W22 FAILS -- 99.7% of atoms have det X_n < 0 (wedge signature 99.7% indefinite): the three sums are NOT moments of one inner product.  [MEASURED] PRET-BREAKS: even a NONNEGATIVE pretentious measure drives det S < 0 (h = 540: min det/detS = -4.199) -- positivity + size of the comb cannot prove det S >= 0; the needed input is a pretentious-distance statement at the dual points.  No marker move, no RH claim.  Python-only, counted per GATE.WOLFRAM.02.  Discovery: experiments/tfpt-discovery/rank3_functionals_probe.py (2026-08-03, 19/19, class verdicts as above)."),
